   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Per-tenant quotas: noisy neighbour\n\u2022 Back pressure: Kafka buffers, shed debug\n\u2022 Cardinality limits on metric labels\n\u2022 Sampling traces (head vs tail)\n\u2022 Hot vs cold tiers: cost per GB\n\u2022 Schema-on-read vs parse at ingest",
   "originalText": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Per-tenant quotas: noisy neighbour\n\u2022 Back pressure: Kafka buffers, shed debug\n\u2022 Cardinality limits on metric labels\n\u2022 Sampling traces (head vs tail)\n\u2022 Hot vs cold tiers: cost per GB\n\u2022 Schema-on-read vs parse at ingest",
